loxicmd-inference-gateway is derived from the loxicmd project. It retargets the
CLI at loxilb-inference-gateway, adding management commands for its
inference-aware L4/L7 load-balancing features. With no AI feature flags used it
behaves as an unmodified loxicmd client for classic loxilb.

